/ModDate (D\07220261111222656\05505\04700\047)
/Producer (ReportLab PDF Library \055 www\056reportlab\056com)
/Subject (Polycrisis conditions may intensify throughout the twenty\055first century\054 but how many people they reach\054 and how hard\054 is not predetermined\056 This report sets out the Positive Pathways framework\054 a development\055focused approach to the reinforcing feedback loops in energy\054 health\054 connectivity\054 learning and institutional capacity that can reduce vulnerability and accelerate human progress\056 It builds on Sustainable Convergence and Polycrisis Resilience\054 which it describes as concepts developed by Hunter Hughes\054 Founder of H Heuristics\054 and treats them as the two applications of one umbrella idea\054 Positive Development Dynamics\072 the development path and the protection it buys\056)
/Title (Positive Pathways\072 A Framework for the Development Loops That Can Cut Human Exposure to Polycrisis This Century)
/Trapped /False
>>
